Keyboard/mouse accessibility: an explicitly held mapped key supplies left-stick
shake/rotation gestures at the final configurable-stick read. Preserve the right
stick and connected controllers (all four slots); disable gestures in scripted tests.
No guest-state detection or gameplay success claim. Synthetic gesture tests cover
30/60 Hz sampling, release, reset and direction coverage.

